:TEST-CATEGORY dependent-types
:TEST-SUBSET indexed-gadts
:TEST-QUALITY integration-regression
:TEST-CONTEXT monadc.context.type-theory.indexed-gadt-refinement
:TEST-PURPOSE Exporting an indexed ADT carries symbolic constructors, dependent methods, and typed field accessors across its module boundary.
:TEST-EXPECT compile
